    "While extra brightness is on, HDR highlights can’t go above the brightened white. Overbright pauses for full-screen video and for video players; add other apps in Settings ▸ Automations." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about washed-out colors",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "While extra brightness is on, HDR highlights can’t go above the brightened white. Overbright pauses for full-screen video and for video players; add other apps in Settings ▸ Automations."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "While extra brightness is on, HDR highlights can’t go above the brightened white. Overbright pauses for full-screen video and for video players; add other apps in Settings ▸ Automations."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dokud je zapnutý extra jas, nemohou nejjasnější místa obrazu HDR přesáhnout zjasněnou bílou. Overbright se pozastavuje u videa na celou obrazovku a u přehrávačů videa; další aplikace přidáte v Nastavení ▸ Automatizace."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når ekstra lysstyrke er slået til, kan HDR-højlys ikke blive lysere end den forstærkede hvide farve. Overbright holder pause ved video på fuld skærm og for videoafspillere – tilføj andre apps under Indstillinger ▸ Automatiseringer."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solange die Zusatzhelligkeit aktiv ist, können HDR-Spitzlichter nicht heller als das aufgehellte Weiß werden. Overbright pausiert bei Vollbildvideos und in Videoplayern; weitere Apps kannst du unter Einstellungen ▸ Automationen hinzufügen."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "While extra brightness is on, HDR highlights can’t go above the brightened white. Overbright pauses for full-screen video and for video players; add other apps in Settings ▸ Automations."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "While extra brightness is on, HDR highlights can’t go above the brightened white. Overbright pauses for full-screen video and for video players; add other apps in Settings ▸ Automations."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "While extra brightness is on, HDR highlights can’t go above the brightened white. Overbright pauses for full-screen video and for video players; add other apps in Settings ▸ Automations."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
