    "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about the brightness keys",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Když je zapnutá volba Přidávat extra jas jen při téměř plném jasu, Overbright přidává světlo jen tehdy, když je jas monitoru téměř plný, takže klávesy jasu si zachovají běžný rozsah. Chcete‑li násobit jakýkoli jas, vypněte ji v Nastavení ▸ Monitory."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når “Tilføj kun ekstra lysstyrke nær fuld lysstyrke” er slået til, tilføjer Overbright kun lys, når skærmen er tæt på fuld lysstyrke, så lysstyrketasterne beholder deres normale område. Slå indstillingen fra under Indstillinger ▸ Skærme for at forstærke enhver lysstyrke."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn „Zusatzhelligkeit nur nahe voller Helligkeit hinzufügen“ aktiv ist, fügt Overbright nur Licht hinzu, wenn das Display nahe voller Helligkeit ist, sodass die Helligkeitstasten ihren normalen Bereich behalten. Deaktiviere die Option unter Einstellungen ▸ Displays, um jede Helligkeit zu verstärken."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "With Add extra brightness only near full brightness on, Overbright adds light only when the display is near full brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn it off in Settings ▸ Displays to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
